<title>The Sahel insurgency: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sahel/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sahel-2026-11-10T01:41:02.579Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 10 Nov 2026 01:41:02 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Militant groups and bandits continue to attack civilians across the Sahel, with armed men killing a pastor, a pregnant woman and schoolchildren in Nigeria and a gunman killing 12 members of one family in the same country. Mali’s forces recaptured Kidal while Russian electronic-warfare vehicles operated in Mali and Russia helped foil a coup in Niger, prompting EU concern over Algerian and Russian troop deployments there. Burkina Faso, after moving closer to Russia, has partnered with another Western state on its 36th reunification anniversary. The conflict still generates high fatalities, with 4,159 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxOZmt6YjJvbWdLVGRoVVg3N1RDTTVMY2otNzZwNk9Ma0lKZ0dCMFVHUGZvSlB5M1dtNG1ia0hTV3ZmOWNMMU5meWoweVp0WFA5V0prU1RSOWVnLWs4ckxaQVlNeGtEdVlIaUl0RFU3TWVpTmQtckE3SC1qY0lfU2VJb2xpNkRIeHAtZ0RsSW1TRWw0aGtRc3dsbnd3?oc=5&quot;&gt;Head Topics&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxQYkNZQ0pwQ3pUYjNVc25DNkxXbzg3OENZSjJTVXdRRGFfTjNSZnhwazJpTGZ4a0s4QkYtdWwzRjNVUHREQmZfNW5FRm92ZzFkazBUSXBtRDNKbm0zQzF5RVF2SGtuOTVJLVJyZUlGaElmZGNNTGlZQ2xtU0YwNEp5b1gtZ1VQOGt1eDBqXzQwZDF5c29PZGxQSUFsQjZxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Kuwait Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQUkRoanFLRlVseFY2NGExUGVIQzVITjd2Wnl1bFBkTUlsMExiZlB3OURjc1VPdE4tZ1VWODY1Yl9iZUpQUXJVWDFNcmtSOHVWVTFzQjNEbmREZ2Q3S0RiLXhveDFqZkhfSTczQ2pxd0VJVUZaNEl3X2hqbEo5U2FCdFo4elFpVm91alBzZ3gzSFdJcU0tQWJmX2NiRG9id3dOZHF0Rm04WQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Truth Nigeria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxNUG5RVW1jX3djZWVmemV0QUZuSVUzV29NMmpIVjducjhDdWFyRjUwTEFpM01ELTlVWHhrcFdLTHRJeEZXNEtJUU9SYmd6bnB